twodrive (0.2.20-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Coalesce exact clean delta echoes before binding renamed initial uploads.
  * Prevent late upload cleanup from deleting cloud IDs with active local owners.
  * Preserve a pending cloud move when an atomic save replaces renamed content.
  * Validate rename/folder names before authentication and network requests.
  * Reconcile missing bound upload targets instead of retrying stale IDs forever.
  * Preserve unsynced local edits as conflict copies without restoring deleted
    originals or overwriting newer same-name cloud objects.
  * Complete missing-original conflict recovery atomically, preserving newer
    saves and concurrent deletion recovery.
  * Add remote-deletion, restart, replacement and active-writer regressions.
  * Retain offline dpkg-buildpackage/debhelper source and binary builds.

